          "source": "inferred", "reason": "Thor/dual-screen guides (aliteq.com and droix.net, search snippets only; not fetchable) say: Landscape Screen Layout = Single Screen and Secondary Display = Bottom Screen. Enum index from settings.h (SingleScreen = 1).",
